# Configuration
UseVirtualStock=Use Virtual Stock
UseVirtualStockHelp=When enabled, calculations use virtual stock (physical stock + planned orders - customer orders). When disabled, only physical stock is used.
WarehousePrefix=Warehouse Prefix
WarehousePrefixHelp=Only warehouses starting with this prefix will be included in stock calculations (e.g., "10001" includes 10001, 100010, 100012, etc.). Leave empty to include all warehouses.
ConsiderMOs=Consider Manufacturing Orders
ConsiderMOsHelp=When enabled, active manufacturing orders (Validated & In Progress) are included in availability calculations.
ConsiderSupplierOrders=Consider Supplier Orders
ConsiderSupplierOrdersHelp=When enabled, incoming supplier orders (Ordered & Partially Received) are included in availability calculations.
ConfigurationHelp=Configuration Help

# About Page
ProductionHierarchyLongDesc=Production Hierarchy provides advanced material requirements planning by analyzing hierarchical BOM structures, current stock levels, active manufacturing orders, and incoming supplier orders. The module generates intelligent suggestions for production (MOs) and procurement to meet your production goals.
Feature1=Hierarchical BOM analysis with multi-level component breakdown
Feature2=Real-time availability calculation (Stock + MOs + Supplier Orders)
Feature3=Intelligent production suggestions based on material availability
Feature4=Procurement suggestions for missing raw materials
Feature5=Direct manufacturing order creation from suggestions
Feature6=Configurable warehouse filtering and calculation options

